    {
      "block_id": "2605.06070_p4_b49",
      "text": "In this chapter, we first construct an Arena to obtain each model\u2019s capability distribution in section\n4.1; then, we perform problem formulation for image quality gap estimation and propose a solution\nbased on latent-variable inference, as detailed in section 4.2; finally, we establish a DPO framework\nwith fine-grained preference in section 4.3.\n",
