    {
      "block_id": "2605.06070_p4_b51",
      "text": "In the preference dataset, each entry consists of a pair of images and a binary label. In addition, the\nmodel source of each image is recorded. Therefore, the dataset can also be viewed as the result of\nlarge-scale pairwise comparisons among multiple models. Based on this observation, we construct an\nArena that includes these models, and, as in the K-Sort Arena [19], the capability of each model is\nprobabilistically modeled as follows:\n",
